            "excerpt_sha256": "596b27564da61fb04b9608dfa319ddbdfc50c796a2fa448ba031667a9f21b958",
            "failure_scenario": "If Parse+empty or Other lost its push, or Parse+non-empty gained one, `pv obligations` would drop or double-count a problem line for an unparseable contract; by the truth table none of the four cells changed.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        },
